# Language providers built into ForgeIDE itself.
#
# LanguagePluginLoader reads this file on the application class loader during
# bootstrap pass 1. Providers listed here win over anything discovered in
# ~/.forge/plugins, so a third-party JAR cannot replace a built-in language.
#
# Kotlin and C++ are deliberately absent: they now ship as
# modules/forge-lang-kotlin and modules/forge-lang-cpp, and are discovered from
# their own JARs. The Lua, Python and Rust providers are not listed until their
# Language implementations are finished.

com.willclay.forgeide.lang.java.JavaLanguageProvider
